---
kind: scene
id: run.recap
title: Last time
pov: ilo
# Plays after the routine once a dive has ended: what the last dive left him with.
on: runStart
once: false
when: "isSet(prev.run.outcome)"
---

## Memory

<match on="prev.run.outcome">
  <when is="died">
    <match on="prev.run.killedBy">
      <when is="eel">
        @ilo{mono}: Last time the eel. Stay off the floor of the long hall.
      </when>
      <when is="choir">
        @ilo{mono}: Last time the choir. Don't listen. Don't hum along.
      </when>
      <when is="regent">
        @ilo{mono}: Last time the throne. I got that far. I can get that far again.
      </when>
      <otherwise>
        @ilo{mono}: Last time the dark just closed over me.
      </otherwise>
    </match>
    ::use{component="gauge" mood="grim"}
  </when>
  <when is="surfaced">
    @ilo{mono}: Last time I came up on my own. The sea let me go.
    ::use{component="gauge" mood="calm"}
  </when>
  <when is="diving">
    @ilo{mono}: Last time never really ended.
  </when>
</match>
